<title>USA: York International Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>York International Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Qtr Ended</p>
<p> March 31				    1997		    1996</p>
<p> Sales					$800.8		 $728.2</p>
<p> Gross Profit				163.7		  153.2</p>
<p> Income from operations		   31.8		   46.5</p>
<p> Net income				   14.9		   24.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share			 0.34		   0.55</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		44,012		 43,505</p>
<p>(in millions, except per share data)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The first quarter includes a restructuring charge of about $13 million, $4 million of which was charged to cost of sales and $9 million of which was included in selling, general and administrative expenses.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
